<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Alex. Brown ups 2 regional airlines.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Alex. Brown ups 2 regional airlines.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it upgraded two regional airlines, Western Pacific Airlines Inc and Reno Air Inc .</p>
<p>-- Raised ratings on both companies to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Western Pacific rose 47/64 to 6-3/4 and Reno Air gained 7/16 to 7-1/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
